{"id":8867,"date":"2024-07-03T07:00:00","date_gmt":"2024-07-03T07:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/?p=8867"},"modified":"2026-05-26T10:06:26","modified_gmt":"2026-05-26T10:06:26","slug":"biggest-mistakes-when-remodeling-your-bathroom","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/biggest-mistakes-when-remodeling-your-bathroom\/","title":{"rendered":"Biggest Mistakes When Remodeling Your Bathroom"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&#8220;<em>Biggest Mistakes When Remodeling Your Bathroom<\/em>&#8220;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Whether you&#8217;re renovating your own bathroom, basement bathroom, or kids&#8217; bathroom, it&#8217;s essential to be aware of the common bathroom remodel mistakes that inexperienced homeowners or renovators often make. Not all bathroom layouts are the same, but there are specific errors that frequently occur. By understanding these pitfalls, you can ensure a successful redesign. Here are the top mistakes to avoid when remodeling your bathroom.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.tileclub.com\/blogs\/news\/10-common-bathroom-remodel-mistakes-and-how-to-avoid-them\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/www.tileclub.com\/blogs\/news\/10-common-bathroom-remodel-mistakes-and-how-to-avoid-them<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/nvkitchenandbath.com\/bathroom-remodeling-mistakes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/nvkitchenandbath.com\/bathroom-remodeling-mistakes<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/jillianlare.com\/bathroom-remodeling-mistakes\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/jillianlare.com\/bathroom-remodeling-mistakes\/<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/ceramic-tiles-installer-2023-11-27-05-25-27-utc-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8873\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Neglecting Proper Planning<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">One of the biggest mistakes in bathroom remodeling is failing to plan properly. This can include not having a clear vision of the final design, not setting a realistic budget, or not considering future needs. Neglecting to plan can lead to costly bathroom remodeling errors and delays. For example, residents in Bend, OR and Lake Oswego, OR have found that thorough planning helps prevent common pitfalls in bathroom remodeling.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Ignoring Ventilation Needs<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Adequate ventilation is crucial in a bathroom to prevent mold and mildew. Ignoring this aspect can lead to significant problems down the line. Make sure to install a proper exhaust fan and consider the placement of windows. This oversight is a frequent bathroom renovation mistake that can be easily avoided with proper planning.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Skimping on Storage<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Another common bathroom remodeling mistake is not incorporating enough storage. Even in small bathrooms, it&#8217;s important to maximize space and storage. Utilize vertical space, consider built-in shelves, and choose vanity units with ample storage. <a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/best-construction-services-in-portland\/\">Homeowners in Portland, OR<\/a> and Happy Valley, OR often find creative storage solutions that enhance both functionality and aesthetics.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Choosing Inappropriate Materials<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Selecting the wrong materials for your bathroom can lead to costly bathroom remodeling errors. Bathrooms are exposed to high humidity, so it&#8217;s important to choose water-resistant and durable materials. Avoid using porous materials that can absorb water and become damaged over time. Residents in Beaverton, OR and Hillsboro, OR have found that investing in quality materials can prevent frequent bathroom renovation mistakes.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/getting-all-the-materials-we-need-online-2023-11-27-05-00-46-utc-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8875\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Overlooking Lighting<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Proper lighting is essential in a bathroom. Overlooking this aspect can result in a space that feels dark and uninviting. Incorporate a mix of task, ambient, and accent lighting to ensure a well-lit bathroom. This is especially important for tasks like shaving and applying makeup. Many homeowners in Tigard, OR and West Linn, OR have successfully avoided bathroom design mistakes by carefully planning their lighting.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6. Poor Layout Decisions<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A functional layout is critical for any bathroom. Poor layout decisions can make the space feel cramped and uncomfortable. Ensure that there is enough clearance around fixtures and that the placement of the toilet, shower, and sink allows for easy movement. This is a common pitfall in bathroom remodeling that can be avoided with careful planning.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">7. Not Hiring Professionals When Needed<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">While DIY projects can be rewarding, some aspects of bathroom remodeling require professional expertise. Plumbing and electrical work, in particular, should be handled by licensed professionals to avoid costly errors and ensure safety. Homeowners in Gresham, OR and Happy Valley, OR often seek professional help for complex tasks to avoid bathroom renovation oversight errors.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">8. Failing to Set a Realistic Budget<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Setting an unrealistic budget is a common bathroom remodel planning mistake. It&#8217;s important to account for all expenses, including materials, labor, permits, and unexpected costs. Overestimating your budget can prevent financial strain and ensure that the project stays on track. Residents in La Pine, OR, and Prineville, OR often recommend consulting with a contractor to get accurate cost estimates.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/bathroom-vanity-2023-11-27-05-01-22-utc-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8876\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">9. Forgetting Future Needs<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When remodeling a bathroom, it&#8217;s important to consider future needs. This includes planning for accessibility and aging in place. Features like grab bars, walk-in showers, and non-slip flooring can make the bathroom safer and more functional for years to come. This consideration can prevent mistakes in bathroom remodeling projects and add long-term value to your home.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">10. Overlooking Permits and Regulations<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Major renovations, such as redesigning bathrooms or expanding rooms, often require permits. Overlooking this step can lead to fines and delays. Make sure to check local regulations and obtain the necessary permits before starting your project. This is a common error to avoid in bathroom renovation that can save time and money in the long run.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conclusion<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Every remodel comes with its own set of potential headaches, but by knowing ahead of time what to expect and what common mistakes homeowners make, you can plan smart and minimize stress. Whether you&#8217;re in Bend, OR, or Redmond, OR, starting your bathroom renovation project with a clear plan and a reliable partner will help you predict and prevent common bathroom renovation mistakes. For more detailed advice on avoiding bathroom remodel mistakes to avoid and ensuring your project goes smoothly, contact <a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/\" title=\"\">Harris &amp; Sons<\/a> at <a href=\"tel:+15413165836\">+1 541-316-5836<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">By avoiding these common errors, you can achieve a stunning bathroom that offers both functionality and style. Remember, thoughtful design and pre-planning are key to a successful bathroom remodel.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.housedigest.com\/894599\/mistakes-everyone-makes-when-renovating-a-bathroom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/www.housedigest.com\/894599\/mistakes-everyone-makes-when-renovating-a-bathroom<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/nvkitchenandbath.com\/bathroom-remodeling-mistakes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/nvkitchenandbath.com\/bathroom-remodeling-mistakes<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.brightviewsiding.com\/blog\/2017\/08\/5-common-bathroom-remodeling-mistakes\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/www.brightviewsiding.com\/blog\/2017\/08\/5-common-bathroom-remodeling-mistakes\/<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>&#8220;Biggest Mistakes When Remodeling Your Bathroom&#8220; Whether you&#8217;re renovating your own bathroom, basement bathroom, or kids&#8217; bathroom, it&#8217;s essential to be aware of the common bathroom remodel mistakes that inexperienced homeowners or renovators often make. Not all bathroom layouts are the same, but there are specific errors that frequently occur. By understanding these pitfalls, you [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":8872,"comm